{"body": "9. No income tax shall be levied upon the wages or personal income of natural persons. Notwithstanding the foregoing provision, and except as otherwise provided in subsection 1 of this Section, taxes may be levied upon the income or revenue of any business in whatever form it may be conducted for profit in the State.", "citation_label": "Nevada Constitution Article 10, Section 1, Subsection 9 1", "citation_path": "us-nv/statute/constitution/article-10/section-1/subsection-9/block-1", "document_class": "statute", "expression_date": "2026-07-24", "heading": "THE CONSTITUTION OF THE STATE OF NEVADA", "id": "c7d1c6a5-6cfe-5c8e-b872-73ac5e6cec62", "jurisdiction": "us-nv", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 1, "content_type": "text/html", "document_subtype": "state_constitution", "download_url": "https://www.leg.state.nv.us/Const/NVConst.html", "kind": "block", "legal_identifier": "Nev. Const. art. 10, \u00a7 1(9)", "primary_source": true, "program": "individual_income_tax", "source_authority": "Nevada Legislature", "source_note": "Current official constitutional prohibition on an income tax upon the wages or personal income of natural persons, together with the express carveout permitting taxes on the income or revenue of a business.", "source_status": "current_official_constitution", "source_url": "https://www.leg.state.nv.us/Const/NVConst.html", "title": "Nevada Constitution Article 10, Section 1, Subsection 9"}, "ordinal": 1, "parent_citation_path": "us-nv/statute/constitution/article-10/section-1/subsection-9", "parent_id": "4076966f-ae79-581e-bbb7-b171e9132393", "source_as_of": "2026-07-24", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-nv-constitution-article-10-section-1-subsection-9", "source_path": "sources/us-nv/statute/2026-07-24-nv-individual-income-tax-zero-liability/official-documents/us-nv-constitution-article-10-section-1-subsection-9.html", "source_url": "https://www.leg.state.nv.us/Const/NVConst.html", "vers